    {
      "id": "unemp5ht7",
      "node_id": "node-save-image-(png)-a1361e2c",
      "version_tag": "v1",
      "title": "Save Image (PNG)",
      "description": {
        "text": {
          "text": {
            "text": {
              "text": {
                "text": {
                  "text": {
                    "text": {
                      "text": {
                        "text": {
                          "text": {
                            "text": {
                              "text": {
                                "text": "This node converts a generated image tensor into PNG byte format, making it suitable for saving, downloading, or passing to external systems. It expects an image tensor in the format [B, 3, H, W] (batch, RGB channels, height, width) with values in the range [0, 1].\n\nThe node first validates the tensor shape and ensures it contains RGB data. It then selects the first image in the batch, clamps values to a valid range, and converts the tensor into a NumPy array with pixel values scaled to [0, 255]. This array is transformed into a PIL image and encoded into PNG format using an in-memory buffer.\n\nA configurable compression level (0–9) allows balancing file size and encoding speed. The final output is raw PNG byte data, which can be directly written to a file or transmitted as needed.",
                                "lineHeight": 14,
                                "fontSize": 11,
                                "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                              },
                              "lineHeight": 14,
                              "fontSize": 11,
                              "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                            },
                            "lineHeight": 14,
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                          },
                          "lineHeight": 14,
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                        },
                        "lineHeight": 14,
                        "fontSize": 11,
                        "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                      },
                      "lineHeight": 14,
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
                    },
